<title>USA: ViroPharma names Nash to chairman post.</title>
<headline>ViroPharma names Nash to chairman post.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ViroPharma Inc said it named its president and chief executive officer, Claude Nash, to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately, the company said.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
